<title>FINLAND: Finnish July GDP rises 3.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish July GDP rises 3.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 3.9 percent year-on-year in July, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.5 percent in July on June, SF said.</p>
<p>			 July 1996	June 1996	July 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +3.9 pct	 +2.4 pct	 +2.6 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.5 pct	 +0.4 pct	 +/-0 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
